  "fylite:resistance_note": "PF channel `resistance` is RECOMPUTED on the cross-sections this document carries: R = η·Σ2πr·N²/(w·h) over the channel's elements, η = 0.017 μΩ·m recovered from the electrical provider's own `resistance` on its own geometry (user ruling 2026-09-13). Fast coils keep the provider's value: their geometry is that provider's, so the two already agree.",
